{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-6","storyName":"来自过去的亡魂","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"宝巫迦因月见夜的重伤而想要不顾一切前往狩猎“雷之主”，武士们也惶惶不安，危急时刻，梓兰站出来主持大局。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["宝巫迦","空爆","梓兰","政宗","义经","武士A","武士B","熔火蜗","武士队长","武士们","兽群们","随从武士","月见夜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":8},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$4","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":14},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"当义经带着宝巫迦、梓兰和政宗赶到现场时，看到的就是空爆跪在月见夜身边，失魂落魄的样子。","id":20},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":21,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见......夜？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，你们来了！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"他还没死，但是状况很不好！","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们听到了“雷之主”的吼叫声，立刻赶了过来！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"到底发生了什么！","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我也不知道，等我赶到的时候，就看到“雷之主”......","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“雷之主”......是它把月见夜变成这样的吗！","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"我......不知道，","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"但我看到了！它......它在用你的力量！","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"和你在宫里净化尸体时一模一样！它把那些野兽的黑气......都吸进自己身体里了！","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你说什么？！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不......不可能......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"真的吗？！你不会看错了喵？","id":47},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（肯定的低吼）","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"它......它不仅杀了母亲......还夺走了属于她的巫女的力量......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是了，原来是这样，难怪它能逆转吾打开的门，难怪它能够召来咒鬼......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"原来是这样，呵，呵呵......原来是这样。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"她跪倒在月见夜身边，伸出手，轻轻地为他拭去脸上的血污。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"她没有哭，一滴眼泪也没有。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦......","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"周围的武士们看到主将倒下，又听到如此骇人听闻的消息，军心彻底崩溃。","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士A","text":"将军他......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士B","text":"那头“异兽”......连前代陛下的力量都能夺走......我们完了......","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","channel":"3","id":79},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":83},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"3","fadetime":"0.5","id":84},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":85,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“异兽”？！不是说每一代的“异兽”只有一头吗！这怎么还有一头！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧——真是乱了套了。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"政宗，宝巫迦，我们从侧面牵制它，寻找弱点！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":95},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦？！","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_hit","volume":"1","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","volume":"1","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"熔火蜗","text":"（愤怒的吼叫）","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2104_1$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"滚开。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，我们——","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"别过来！吾一个人能解决它。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"正好......","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","volume":"1","id":131},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","x":"-127","y":"-6","layer":"1","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"bgeffect","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦——！！！","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":148},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"bgeffect","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"她没事喵！","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"她疯了！她居然利用爆炸的冲击力作为掩护和推力来移动，只为了靠近熔火蜗！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_purifymagic","volume":"1","channel":"5","id":159},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"2.5","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":163},{"type":"bgeffect","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"她......她居然在直接净化熔火蜗？！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"别做傻事喵！陛下，这对你的身体损耗很大喵！","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"bgeffect","id":176},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":177},{"type":"text","text":"然而，宝巫迦对于周围的一切都置若罔闻。","id":178},{"type":"text","text":"她只是压制着熔火蜗，无论熔火蜗怎么甩动身体，她都一动不动。","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"直到熔火蜗的身体缓缓瘫倒。","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_fall","volume":"1","channel":"fall","id":182},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fall","fadetime":"3","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦！我们可以帮你的！","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......还不够。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":189,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦站起身，她没有看任何人，径直走向了天坑的边缘，那姿态，仿佛要抛下身后的一切，独自跃入深渊。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"站住！","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这不关你们的事了。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你的士兵怎么办？你的国家怎么办？他们都在看着你！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦缓缓地回头，空洞的眼神看得梓兰心中一寒。","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾现在......什么也看不见。吾只要它的命。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"陛下，请......三思。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见夜如今已经倒下，你们还要代替他阻止吾吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"正因为将军倒下了，我才要代替将军说这句话——","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"狩猎“雷之主”一事，需要从长——","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"1","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":213},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦，别冲动！","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“雷之主”已经危害到了吾国！它还伤害了月见夜！","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你要吾如何冷静？！","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"我等日夜追随将军，将军如今倒下，我等心中也万分难过。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"但正因如此，我等才谨记将军教诲，狩猎“雷之主”一事，需要从长计议！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"140,0","duration":"0.5","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呜哇——","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"让开！","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"都给我住手！","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"梓兰小姐，请您——","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你们真是被那家伙教得跟他一样死脑筋。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"现在最要紧的是把你们的将军抬上担架，送回城里急救！他还没死！","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"然后留下一批人守在这里，防止有野兽从天坑下爬上来！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"但——","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"没有但是！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"明白。按照梓兰小姐的话做！","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士们","text":"是！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"然后是你，宝巫迦。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我不管你现在脑子里在想什么。但你想下去，我也想下去。那家伙不死，我们回不了家。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我不会劝你放下仇恨，那很虚伪。但是，你应该比任何人都清楚“雷之主”的强大。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"所以，我们会和你一起去狩猎它。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......好。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（看她的眼神，她并没有被我说服，但现在也没有别的办法了......）","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"梓兰小姐......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我从没答应过你们的将军，要阻止宝巫迦去狩猎“雷之主”。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"但——","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你们的将军应该告诉过你们，狩猎团是为了什么而存在的。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"是为了让陛下能够狩猎“雷之主”。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"现在不正是那个时候了吗？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"您......说得是。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（低声）这是眼下最好的方法，我会尽量想办法稳住她。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"......万事拜托您了。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"拿纸和笔来。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"咦？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我要写一封信。告诉斑弥罗，等你们的将军醒后代我将信交给他。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"我明白了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"政宗，空爆，义经！准备绳索和照明用具！","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们......准备狩猎。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":313,"musicid":3},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodengate_crack","volume":"1","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"不行了！门快破了！快用滚木和火油！","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"它们的眼睛！它们的关节！那里是弱点！全员，听我命令，集火攻击它们的薄弱处！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","volume":"1","channel":"2","delay":"0.2","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兽群们","text":"（惬意的喊叫）","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow_rain","volume":"1","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"城墙上的武士们也纷纷射出箭矢，但都如石沉大海，无法对那些皮糙肉厚的野兽造成任何有效伤害。","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"不行......太硬了......","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"兽群们仿佛被这些骚扰激怒，它们后退几步，发出震耳欲聋的咆哮，随即以更猛烈的姿态，全力撞向了城门。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodengate_crack","volume":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"完了——！","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"果然，没有将军和陛下在，我们是不行的！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"......不，还不到放弃的时候！","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"陛下和两位“异兽猎人”已经前往狩猎“雷之主”了，我们要撑到那个时候——","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"要撑到什么时候？","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"......就算是为了将军，我们也必须保护好都城！","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"将军保护了这个国家十年之久，现在，轮到我们保护他了！","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"要跑就跑吧，我不会怪你。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"......对不住，队长。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"4","id":355},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"4","fadetime":"1.5","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"跑吧，跑了也好。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士队长","text":"哼，野兽们，到你们的死期了。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_bg_71_g9_undergroundbamboo.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":376},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":380},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":381,"musicid":4},{"type":"text","text":"月见夜还记得见前代陛下最后一面时的情景。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下，请三思。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"斥候的回报很不乐观，此次的“异兽”远比记载中任何一次都要强大。我们尚未做好万全的准备，远征队......已经折损了近半。","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"您还是不愿听我的吗？","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"您的身体......您以为我没有发现吗？那晚您在庭院中咳出的血，那方手帕上刺眼的漆黑！","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"您早已被“诅咒”深度侵蚀，再去战斗，无异于自尽！","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"您不为自己着想，也请为国家着想！为宝巫迦殿下着想！她还那么年幼，她不能没有母亲！泡影国也不能没有您！","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"是我的错吗？是我不够强大，才需要您一次又一次地亲赴险境？只要您说，只要您一句话，我愿意为您献上一切！","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"所以......求您了......留下来。不要去。","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"为什么......为什么还是要走？","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"站住！我命令您站住！","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......不......我没有资格命令您......","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"求您......别走......","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":401},{"type":"text","text":"那是他最后一次见到前代陛下。","id":402},{"type":"text","text":"我们已经失去了前代陛下。","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"泡影国不能再失去宝巫迦陛下了。","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦陛下天资聪颖，假以时日，必然能够成长为和前代陛下一样出色的国主。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"但是，时间，对了，我们需要时间......","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"为了时间，为了宝巫迦陛下能够顺利长大......","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"我情愿让她去恨我，去将对“雷之主”的恨意倾泻到我的身上。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"至少这样更安全。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"但是——","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"这样便对吗？","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"bgeffect","id":415},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":416},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":417},{"type":"image","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419}],"characters":["宝巫迦","空爆","梓兰","政宗","义经","武士A","武士B","熔火蜗","武士队长","武士们","兽群们","随从武士","月见夜"]}